            meaningVn: e.meaningVn,
            meaningEn: e.meaningEn,
            isFavorite: e.isFavorite,
            isLearned: e.isLearned,
          ),
        )
        .toList();
  }

  Future<void> cacheData(List<VocabularyModel> data) async {
    await appDatabase.cacheVocabularies(data);
  }
}
